== Wi-Fi: 2.4 and 5 GHz, Kismet hopping, a damaged record every 50
   source esp32c5:device=/tmp/esp32c5-e2e,mode=wifi,name=fake-wifi
   source: running=1 error='' packets=200 hopping=1 channel='6' interface='esp32c5' capif='esp32c5-pts/2'
   phys: IEEE802.11
   names: 'ESP32C5-FAKE-24', 'ESP32C5-FAKE-5HIGH', 'ESP32C5-FAKE-5LOW'
PASS wifi source running
PASS wifi frames decoded as 802.11
PASS 2.4 GHz access point seen
PASS 5 GHz access points seen (hopping works)
PASS damaged record noticed
PASS capture continues after resync
== Wi-Fi: every 7th frame holds the restart signature in its SSID and a vendor element
   source esp32c5:device=/tmp/esp32c5-e2e,name=fake-inject
   source: running=1 error='' packets=180 hopping=1 channel='6' interface='esp32c5' capif='esp32c5-pts/2'
   phys: IEEE802.11
   names: 'ESP32C5-FAKE-24', 'ESP32C5-FAKE-5HIGH', 'ESP32C5-FAKE-5LOW', 'FAKE-INJECT<<START>>\\nxD4'
PASS source running with the injected frames
PASS the fake sent injected frames
PASS no sync lost to a frame's payload
PASS no stream restart read from a frame's payload
PASS the injected frame reached Kismet (its BSSID seen)
PASS the injected frame's SSID is seen
PASS the other frames are seen too
== Wi-Fi: the board restarts its stream in place every 40 records
   source esp32c5:device=/tmp/esp32c5-e2e,name=fake-restart
   source: running=1 error='' packets=283 hopping=1 channel='6' interface='esp32c5' capif='esp32c5-pts/2'
   phys: IEEE802.11
   names: '02:E5:C5:00:00:0A', '0A:3C:3C:53:54:41', '3C:3C:53:54:41:52', 'ESP32C5-FAKE-24', 'ESP32C5-FAKE-5HIGH', 'ESP32C5-FAKE-5LOW'
PASS source running through the restarts
PASS the fake cut a record short
PASS a restart at a record boundary noticed
PASS a restart after a record cut short noticed
PASS capture resumes after each restart
== 802.15.4 as esp32c5zigbee-<port>: the board boots in Wi-Fi and reboots, its port staying open
   source esp32c5zigbee-pts/1:name=fake-zigbee
   source: running=1 error='' packets=349 hopping=1 channel='15' interface='esp32c5zigbee-pts/1' capif='esp32c5-pts/1'
   phys: 802.15.4
   names: '10:01', '25:01', 'FF:FF'
PASS the name asks for 802.15.4
PASS board rebooted in place
PASS no START lost in the reboot
PASS zigbee source running after the reboot
PASS frames decoded as 802.15.4
PASS interface is esp32c5zigbee-pts/1
PASS capture interface is the port as --list names it (esp32c5-pts/1)
